{
  "__doc": "Player archetypes, now written in terms of the 29 SUB-STATS from attributes.json. `bias` is added to a sub-stat at generation, before the 2-3 spikes / 2-3 tanks are applied on top. `strengthPool` and `weaknessPool` decide WHICH sub-stats get spiked or tanked, so an IGL is unlikely to roll a huge Flicks spike. Copy a block and give it a new id to add your own.",
  "__bias_note": "Any sub-stat you leave out of `bias` is simply 0. You do not have to list all 29.",

